      "id": "claim_31c0d7f76d134e7b993daeb0900820cb",
      "statement": "The decision core models each cell's lifecycle as a Phase that maps onto the Durable Objects states: Inactive, Resident (active or idle), Dormant (out of memory, still owned), and hibernated (Dormant with surviving hibernatable sockets).",
