        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_5723c16afa9346ddb8970a09c30cfe53",
      "statement": "All behavioral state advances only through on_event, which consumes one Event and returns a list of Effects; the production executor performs those effects and feeds completion events back, and no adapter may mutate State directly.",
